  "description": "GETSAD crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group C 2/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C100 H100 Dy4 N32 O16,2(C1 H4 O1). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy1A (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy2A (Dy) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 4 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.870-4.009 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 108.84-114.12°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Dy4(L1)4(OH)4]·2CH3OH. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 4 OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
